abstract: >
  HERESY v2.0.0 is an offline React application containing a bounded
  Commodore BASIC V2-style runtime. Numeric BASIC DATA statements reconstruct
  the component specification consumed by an inner React component, while CI
  enforces deterministic tests and a 1,474,560-byte production build ceiling.
